          "docs": "Retrieve conversion metrics for a specific post within a campaign.\nThis endpoint is useful for analyzing the performance of individual posts in terms of conversion metrics.\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Conversion Metrics by Publisher",
            "type": "http"
